# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BMad workflow artefacts — PRDs, epics, story files, sprint status,
# audit reports, and other developer-facing planning output. Tracked in
# git for collaboration but never shipped inside container images.
# Keep the patterns wide so any of the BMad layout variants (root
# `_bmad-output/`, scoped `_bmad/`, alternate `bmad-output/`) get
# excluded if a future install lands one of them.
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
